000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID. T7PODELT.
000400 AUTHOR.  KURT MOVSESIAN.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN. JULY 15, 1981.
000700
000800***********************************************************
000900**                                                       **
001000*D    T 7 P O D E L T . S O U R C E                      **
001100**                                                       **
001200*D    THIS IS A SPECIAL PO                               **
001300*D    DELETE PROGRAM THAT DELETES P.Os GREATER THAN      **
001400*D    A CERTAIN DELETE-DATE.  THE P.O. DOES NOT HAVE     **
001500*D    HAVE TO BE COMPLETE FOR IT TO BE DELETED.          **
001100**                                                       **
001600*D     NOTE: ONORDER IS ADJUSTED TO QTY DELIVERED IF     **
001700*D           ONORDER IS LESS THAN DELIVERED AND MSTORERM **
001800*D           ONORDER IS ADJUSTED ACCORDINGLY. A TC '321' **
001900*D           IS ALSO CUT IF QTY ORDERED IS CHANGED       **
002000*D           TO QTY DELIVERED THUS KEEPING THE IBM       **
002100*D           IN SINK WITH THE HP.                        **
001100**                                                       **
002200*D    IT CALLS...                                        **
002300*D      'SPOHIST' TO COPY THE PO INTO THE HISTORY DB     **
002400*D      AND THEN CALLS 'SDELTPO' TO DO THE ACTUAL PO     **
002500*D      DELETION.                                        **
      *****************************************************************


      *****************************************************************
      **            M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      *****************************************************************
      *C 09/05/96   JEFF BUNGO
      *C    EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C    COMPUTE CENTURY ON ENTERED DELETION DATE AND
      *C    COMPARE AGAINST CCYYMMDD PO DATE.
      *C---------------------------------------------------------------
      *C  04/02/2003    DCR  DAN RAUCH
      *C  DCR01 - ADDED LOGIC FOR PO LOGGING
      *C
      *C   JAN 08, 2004   CA YODER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO PASS PARAMETER TO SDELTPO THAT THE ITEM
      *C   IS BEING MOVED TO HISTORY.
      *C
      *****************************************************************

006900 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
007000 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
007100 SOURCE-COMPUTER.   HP-3000.
007200 OBJECT-COMPUTER.   HP-3000.
007300
007400 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
007500 FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT PO-DELETE-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-PODELT.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DPORECD-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MPORCV-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

007800 DATA DIVISION.
007900 FILE SECTION.
008000
008100 FD  PO-DELETE-FILE
008200     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
008300     RECORD CONTAINS 14 CHARACTERS.
008400 01  PO-DEL-RCD.
008500     05  PO-DEL-NUM         PIC X(14).
008600
       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS  OF MCFLCS0501.

       FD  DPORECD-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPORECD-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS  OF MCFLCS0901.

       FD  MPORCV-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPORCV-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS  OF MCFLCS0101.
008700
008800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
008900 77  COMPANY-SAVE               PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
009000 77  PO-DELETE-MONTHS           PIC 9(2)  VALUE ZEROS.
009100 77  ACCEPT-CO-CODE             PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
009200 77  CONT-SW                    PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
009300
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".

009400 01  INVOICE-INDIC-SW           PIC X     VALUE SPACES.
009500     88  INVOICING                        VALUE "Y".
009600
009700 01  BUILD-PO-LAST-PAYMENT.
009800     05  BUILD-PO-LAST-PAY-YYMM PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
009900     05  BUILD-PO-LAST-PAY-DD   PIC 9(2)  VALUE ZEROS.
010000
010100 01  BUILD-PO-NUM.
010200     05  FILLER                   PIC X(1) VALUE SPACES.
010300     05  PO-NUM1-2                PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
010400     05  FILLER                   PIC X(11) VALUE SPACES.

DCR01 *--------------------------------------------------------------
DCR01  01  WS-Z000-EXTRA-FLDS.
DCR01      03  WS-Z000-PGM        PIC X(10)       VALUE "T7PODELT".
DCR01  COPY POLOGSUBWS  IN COPYLIB.
